  "description": "A society where class is determined from birth, where the strong prey on the weak. Among them, Hwang Ji-Hwan, a rabbit classified as the lowest class and weakest, is treated like trash by society, scraping by through gambling and scams. One day, while pulling off a scam as usual, Ji-Hwan becomes entangled with the fox organization at the apex of this survival-of-the-fittest hierarchy and finds his life threatened.\n\n *“He's mine, so you guys can get lost.”*\n\nAt that moment, the fox Jang Wi-Ran, whom he had slept with by chance three years prior, appears and rescues Ji-Hwan... \n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
